📋 Core Specifications
Specification	Target Value	Purpose
Target Environment	American Truck Simulator (ATS)	Native asset overriding via def/world/animated_gate.sii
High-Speed Approach Range	125.0m – 135.0m	Ensures seamless gate activation at highway speeds for heavy multi-axle rigs
